 Screenshot 4.png", "id": "873992396602223", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974864_873992399935556_1633622422788963725_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=jxOnV0pRe-IQ7kNvwG9sZSP&_nc_oc=AdoFsJBUx2Xb4eF5pR29W56mHggavl9RbPv9rMwxEeUjbkK8CUN_s8TYUXGaOotwzXo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af13rH4shkwAh_TUONRJNqQTrf0eA-dl24WQYh8VHWaxfg&oe=69DCD73E"}, {"file_name": "EEC Screenshot 5.png", "id": "5395686713791034", "uri": "https://scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974748_5395686717124367_6902466276144487558_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=c5tUbNGdTAQQ7kNvwGrHCUu&_nc_oc=AdqFcwakgeMw1xo5yb_jippsyibJ5mwj6LZzraWppWb2XqI_A6nkNm650KZi_f4kAmY&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-ord5-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7a30f&oh=00_Af2S1lMMubbncBiukNxA2qyeq1Muiwe_7ODn7m85ItD_hQ&oe=69DCD586"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "Ellic's Exercise Class", "keywords": [], "long_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!", "short_description": "This is a VR exergame called \u201cEllic\u2019s Exercise Class\u201d. Ellic will guide you through the play. The game includes seven mini exercise games: blocking, goalkeeper, volleyball, archery, skeet, baseball, and shooter. You will interact with virtual objects by moving your body and arms and triggering sporting events with the handheld controllers. Join Ellic's Exercise Class today! Each mini-game has three difficulty levels, and there must be a level right for you!"}]}, "developer_